    <string name="policy_title">Your privacy</string>
    <string name="policy_body">ONE SECOND! by Play Everywhere works offline. Only level progress, language and sound settings are saved on this device. The game does not collect or share personal data and contains no advertising or analytics SDKs. It does not access contacts, files, microphone, camera, location or the advertising identifier. No account is required. Clear the app data or uninstall the game to delete its local data. If you choose to open the online policy, your browser visits GitHub under its privacy policy. Contact: daw81bk@gmail.com.</string>
